    "directions": [
      "Combine milk and sugar in a pan and heat carefully to 65 °C.",
      "Peel and microplane ginger, and squeeze out the juice.",
      "Place juice in a bowl and pour milk into the ginger juice from a height to allow sufficient mixing.",
      "Do NOT stir as this will interfere with the gel formation.",
      "Leave to set at room temperature.",
      "After 5-10 min a gel has formed. The curd may be served immediately or kept in the fridge."
